# Scratch diagnostic output from the migration pipeline (regenerated each run).
.migration_reports/

# The rendered engine support matrix (RFC 0015 §11). Generated, not committed:
# it is ~300 KB today and grows with every bundle and every new gfx target,
# which is both a large diff on every sidecar edit and close enough to the size
# at which GitHub stops rendering a markdown file to be a problem. It is a pure
# view of the committed .support.json sidecars, so anyone can rebuild it from a
# plain checkout -- no GPU, no plugin, no DVC:
#   python3 dnn-providers/integration-tests/scripts/render_support_matrix.py
SUPPORT_MATRIX.md
